"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965230242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":255,"original_line":255,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1961645944,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965230745","pull_request_review_id":2632613569,"id":1965230745,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc51IwqZ","diff_hunk":"@@ -5218,12 +5218,15 @@ Size2i SubViewport::get_size() const {\n \n void SubViewport::set_size_2d_override(const Size2i &p_size) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n-\t_set_size(_get_size(), p_size, true);\n+\t_set_size(_get_size(), Size2(p_size), true);","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"315cc5e4375e0eb21c083b33f6759e85714fc689","original_commit_id":"6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fair, I removed the redundant conversion.","created_at":"2025-02-21T10:18:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T10:19:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965230745","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965230745"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965230745"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965230745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":5221,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1961628011,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":36,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965329396","pull_request_review_id":2632778735,"id":1965329396,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc51JIv0","diff_hunk":"@@ -252,7 +252,7 @@ class Viewport : public Node {\n \tTransform2D stretch_transform;\n \n \tSize2i size = Size2i(512, 512);\n-\tSize2i size_2d_override;\n+\tSize2 size_2d_override;","path":"scene/main/viewport.h","commit_id":"315cc5e4375e0eb21c083b33f6759e85714fc689","original_commit_id":"6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"That's not quite right. The `final_size_override` that is passed to `_set_size` is defined within a function (`Window::_update_viewport_size`) and is a result of math (division of size by content scale) rather than explicit intent. That math is why it needed to be floats. So, there is nothing to match to or expose in the first place. And, it's the only consideration for fixing the MRP.\r\n\r\nSo, `final_size_override` and the `_set_size` function that it's passed to are the only necessary changes. Anything else is beyond the scope of fixing the MRP and can be considered in a future PR.","created_at":"2025-02-21T11:30:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T11:34:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965329396","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965329396"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965329396"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965329396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":255,"original_line":255,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1961645944,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965393306","pull_request_review_id":2632897527,"id":1965393306,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc51JYWa","diff_hunk":"@@ -252,7 +252,7 @@ class Viewport : public Node {\n \tTransform2D stretch_transform;\n \n \tSize2i size = Size2i(512, 512);\n-\tSize2i size_2d_override;\n+\tSize2 size_2d_override;","path":"scene/main/viewport.h","commit_id":"315cc5e4375e0eb21c083b33f6759e85714fc689","original_commit_id":"6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"No, the reason it needs to be a float is because the original assumption that `size_2d_override` (aka the size of the viewport in render-space) can be described as a Vector2i just doesn't hold in general. A side effect of this assumption is the bug that we are fixing in the first place.\r\n\r\nChanging only that one part where this bug manifests leaves the class in an inconsistent state, where certain assumptions that you would expect won't hold anymore.\r\n\r\nFor example, `stretch_transform.scale != size / size_2d_override` which would be a very reasonable thing to expect, and other code might depend on in.","created_at":"2025-02-21T12:22:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T13:09:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965393306","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965393306"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1965393306"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1965393306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":255,"original_line":255,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1961645944,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1966227383","pull_request_review_id":2634319361,"id":1966227383,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc51Mj-3","diff_hunk":"@@ -252,7 +252,7 @@ class Viewport : public Node {\n \tTransform2D stretch_transform;\n \n \tSize2i size = Size2i(512, 512);\n-\tSize2i size_2d_override;\n+\tSize2 size_2d_override;","path":"scene/main/viewport.h","commit_id":"315cc5e4375e0eb21c083b33f6759e85714fc689","original_commit_id":"6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"That's a good point. `_set_size` saves the passed in override to the `Viewport`'s `size_2d_override` (truncated, if only the parameter is `Size2`) after it's used to calculate the `stretch_transform` scale. So, there would be some data loss there that is out of sync with the new `stretch_transform`.","created_at":"2025-02-21T21:40:31Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T21:40:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1966227383","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1966227383"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#discussion_r1966227383"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1966227383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":255,"original_line":255,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1961645944,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"}]